1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:03,540
Highway ke pedon pe safed-laal rang kyun lagate hain?

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:05,110
Yeh sirf decoration nahi hai.

3
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:08,500
Isse ped bhi bachta hai, aur raat ko aap bhi. Kaise?

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,410
Pehla kaam: ped ki suraksha.

5
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:14,600
Safed rang chuna hai, jo keedon ko tane pe upar chadhne nahi deta.

6
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,400
Laal rang geru hai, iron wali laal mitti,

7
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:21,410
jo fungus aur tana khokhla karne wale keedon se ped ko bachata hai.

8
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:23,460
Doosra kaam: aapki safety.

9
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:28,000
Raat ko gaadi ki headlight jab safed rang pe padti hai, toh woh alag se chamakta hai.

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,320
Driver ko sadak ka kinara saaf dikhta hai, aur gaadi ped se nahi takrati.

11
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:36,010
Matlab ek rang, do kaam: ped ki safety bhi, aapki bhi.

12
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:40,840
Aise roz ke "kyun" ke liye Whysplained ko subscribe karo!
